or a failover that promoted

68
00:04:20,409 --> 00:04:24,639
a replica whose session
store predated a revocation.

69
00:04:25,139 --> 00:04:27,879
Conventional recovery
metrics do not merely

70
00:04:27,879 --> 00:04:29,209
