78
00:04:56,529 --> 00:04:59,949
So the envelope sits
above them as a decision

79
00:04:59,979 --> 00:05:01,259
layer with three moves.

80
00:05:01,539 --> 00:05:03,529
First, bound the damage.

81
00:05:04,299 --> 00:05:08,369
For each candidate plan,
translate the evidence you

82
00:05:08,399 --> 00:05:12,749
actually hold into a, a
conservative upper bound on

83
00:05:12,799 --> 00:05:14,419
