84
00:05:15,009 --> 00:05:18,359
Second, filter by
hard constraints.

85
00:05:19,099 --> 00:05:22,959
Any plan that could cross a
prohibited line is removed

86
00:05:23,309 --> 00:05:25,099
before anyone discusses speed.

87
00:05:25,599 --> 00:05:30,379
Third, select among the
survivors using Pareto

88
00:05:30,379 --> 00:05:35,279
dominance, then policy
weights, and write down why.

89
00:05:36,129 --> 00:05:39,749
The consequence is that
the controller is allowed

90
00:05:40,039 --> 00:05:43,949
