107
00:06:37,669 --> 00:06:42,789
It means you do not know, and
not knowing is priced as risk.

108
00:06:43,589 --> 00:06:46,469
This is also the model's
impossibility boundary.

109
00:06:47,159 --> 00:06:51,439
It cannot prove sink or
external effect state that

110
00:06:51,439 --> 00:06:54,869
the platform never recorded,
and it does not pretend to

111
00:06:55,369 --> 00:06:58,109
Here is the
protocol end-to-end.

112
00:06:58,109 --> 00:07:01,589
Enumerate a bounded
candidate set from real

113
00:07:01,589 --> 00:07:04,859
