115
00:07:07,429 --> 00:07:09,079
Apply the hard constraints.

116
00:07:09,439 --> 00:07:12,079
Any candidate whose
conservative upper bound

117
00:07:12,389 --> 00:07:15,679
crosses a prohibited line
