compute Pareto dominance.

120
00:07:22,359 --> 00:07:24,929
A candidate is dominated
when another candidate

121
00:07:24,929 --> 00:07:28,079
is no worse in every
dimension and strictly

122
00:07:28,089 --> 00:07:29,479
