123
00:07:30,479 --> 00:07:32,519
Dominated plans drop out.

124
00:07:33,309 --> 00:07:37,279
Only then apply policy
weights and the availability

125
00:07:37,279 --> 00:07:40,719
budget to choose among
the non-dominated plans.

126
00:07:41,499 --> 00:07:45,749
Finally, journal the
feasible set, the rejected

127
00:07:45,749 --> 00:07:48,269
candidates with the
constraint that rejected

128
00:07:48,279 --> 00:07:53,269
them, and the selected plan
before execution starts.

129
00:07:54,049 --> 00:07:56,769
Two things I want a
security audience to notice.

130
00:07:57,649 --> 00:08:01,159
Safety is separated from
optimization, so the safety

131
00:08:01,159 --> 00:08:04,979
part can be audited on its
own, and the fastest plan

132
00:08:05,359 --> 00:08:10,019
